ng>\u0928\u0908 \u0930\u093e\u091c\u094d\u092f \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0937\u0926</strong> \u0925\u0940\u0964<br />\ud83d\udc49 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u093e \u0909\u0926\u094d\u0926\u0947\u0936\u094d\u092f <strong>\u092a\u094d\u0930\u0936\u093e\u0938\u0928\u093f\u0915 \u0938\u0941\u0927\u093e\u0930 \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u0930\u093e\u092e\u0930\u094d\u0936</strong> \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0926\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u0925\u093e\u0964</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\u270d\ufe0f \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u0939\u0948 &ndash; <strong>1877&nbsp;</strong></p>", "hasMultipleAnswers": false, "type": "multiple_choice", "isAttempted": true, "isPartiallyCorrect": false, "isCorrect": true, "isGraceMarked": false, "isReevaluated": false, "isBookmark": false, "studentQuestionId": "6ac94d4a78803fbef58c4666", "marks": {"positive": 2, "negative": 0}, "timeTaken": 9000, "markForReview": false, "isGpscType": false, "isSurrendered": false, "difficultyLevel": null}, {"_id": "68e0b4af1c2445df4855e387", "name": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans';\"><strong>\u0930\u093e\u091c\u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938 \u091c\u093f\u0932\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 &ldquo;\u092f\u0941\u0926\u094d\u0927 \u0938\u0902\u0917\u094d\u0930\u0939\u093e\u0932\u092f</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri,serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',serif;\"><strong>\" </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans';\"><strong>\u0915\u0940 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u092a\u0928\u093e \u0905\u0917\u0938\u094d\u0924</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri,serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',serif;\"><strong>, 2015 </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><span lang=\"hi-IN\">